flowchart TB
  U[URL only] --> A[URL acquisition extension<br/>Selected for submitted URL<br/>Granted fetch + staged writes]
  A --> H[Host completes ingestion atomically<br/>All original bytes stored<br/>Acquisition failure: no Input]
  B[Uploaded files / folders<br/>Pasted text / browser capture<br/>Already downloaded bytes] -->|direct ingestion: bypass acquisition| H
  H --> I[Input: inputId + originals array<br/>Every artifact has stored bytes<br/>Origin: none / URL / file path]
  I --> P[Artifact processor<br/>Process assigned batch once<br/>Scoped read / write / transcribe]
  P --> M[Return 1+ publication manifests<br/>Each selects its own artifact set]
  M --> V[Host validates ALL manifests]
  V -->|valid| S[Create items atomically<br/>Host assigns each item ID<br/>Mark Input processed]
  V -->|invalid / processing failure| X[No published items]
  S --> R[Per-item search + readable fallback<br/>Optional isolated component<br/>Read only explicit artifact set]
